        "{\"a2uiMeta\":{\"note\":\"Let's play. I'm dealing blackjack from a fresh shoe, and your bankroll starts at 1,000.\\n\\nQuick rules: two cards each, and I show one dealer card with the hole card face down. A natural (an ace plus a ten-value card) pays 3:2 right away unless the dealer also has one, which is a push. Otherwise you act first with hit, stand or double, and you can split pairs. The dealer draws to 17 and stands on all 17s. A win pays 1:1, and a tie is a push.\\n\\nSet your bet on the table below and deal.\",\"trace\":{\"turnIndex\":0,\"query\":{\"intent\":\"## Referenced for this message\\n### blackjack (resource)\\nblackjack, 21, hit, stand, double, split: the classic house game\\n\\nTwo cards each; dealer shows one, hole card face-down. Values: pips as printed, faces 10, Ace 1 or 11. A natural (Ace + ten-card on the deal) ends the round at once: reveal the hole card, settle it (3:2 unless the dealer also has 21, then a push), and offer no hit, stand or double. Otherwise the player acts first: hit, stand, double (one card, doubled stake), split pairs; over 21 busts immediately. Dealer then reveals and draws to 17, standing on all 17s. Blackjack (Ace + ten-card) pays 3:2, a win pays 1:1, equal totals push.\\n\\nLet's play blackjack.\",\"k\":3},\"exemplarIds\":[\"domain-croupier-card-table-round\",\"frontier-round-outcome\",\"frontier-result-card-win\"],\"rounds\":1,\"healed\":0,\"failureCodes\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-5-5\",\"prompt\":{\"limit\":150200,\"total\":62350,\"sections\":[{\"id\":\"grammar\",\"chars\":27654},{\"id\":\"components\",\"chars\":22903},{\"id\":\"functions\",\"chars\":145},{\"id\":\"few-shot\",\"chars\":3515},{\"id\":\"mini-skills\",\"chars\":2358},{\"id\":\"persona\",\"chars\":5775}],\"over\":false},\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":4790,\"outputTokens\":1536,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":19032,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":0},\"miniSkillIds\":[\"card-layout\",\"game-table-chrome\",\"game-hud\"],\"cacheBoundary\":50702}}}",
